# Publications

`publications/index.php` uses two `publication_table()` calls: **Published Papers**, then **Theses**. Do not merge them. Do not invent titles, DOIs, or URLs.

Hosted PDFs live in `publications/docs/`. Faraz Chahili’s SBS thesis (August 2026) is `publications/docs/FarazChahili_Thesis.pdf`. Extra title-cell files go in `'more'`. `publication_table()` does not use `link_table` type tags.
